Third-party software

purify-edge depends on DOMPurify (https://github.com/cure53/DOMPurify), which is licensed
under its own terms (Apache-2.0 or MPL-2.0, at your option), and on parse5
(https://github.com/inikulin/parse5, MIT). Both are installed as ordinary npm dependencies.
DOMPurify is not copied, vendored or modified here and is not redistributed in this package's
source files. The CommonJS build in dist/ bundles parse5 (MIT) and imports DOMPurify at run time.
